WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:05.420
In 2018, an original horror film from a guy
best known for starring in The Office​ premiered,

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.420
and much like the murderous creatures at the
heart of the story, the buzz quickly spread.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:13.460
It wasn't long before we learned that A Quiet
Place Part II was on the way.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.780
Here's what we know so far.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.220
The world of A Quiet Place is a whole world,
despite the relative isolation of the main

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.020
characters at the heart of the first film.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.060
We only see this strange apocalypse and the
creatures which caused it through the lens

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:29.150
of the Abbott family, whose lives largely
revolve around their rural home and brief

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.780
trips into nearby towns to search for supplies.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:37.060
We rarely glimpse other survivors in the film,
and when we do they're brief and brutal, reminding

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.760
us that it's very difficult to stay alive
in this world.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.060
“ah”

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.840
While the sequel will expand upon the relatively
small scale of the first film, the Abbott

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.480
family will remain its focus.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:53.260
Emily Blunt, Millicent Simmonds, and Noah
Jupe will all be back as Evelyn, Regan, and

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:54.340
Marcus, respectively.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:58.520
So, if you're eager to see what life is like
for the Abbotts now, you're going to get your

00:00:58.520 --> 00:00:59.020
wish.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:04.280
A Quiet Place roots its story in a very personal
way, offering very few glimpses of the rest

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:04.880
of the world.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:09.600
There is a sense of a larger world at work
beyond the first film's single-family story,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.980
though, and unsurprisingly, the second film
is going to explore that.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.520
Writer/director John Krasinkski explained:

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:20.080
"The thing that I loved in the movie, where
my mind kept wandering as we were making it,

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:23.810
was the question of who was on the other end
of those fires, when the father lights the

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:26.240
fire and in the distance those other fires
light up.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:27.850
How did those people survive?

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:29.280
How did that old man survive?"

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.540
That means that, in addition to the returning
stars who will reprise their roles as the

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:37.080
Abbotts, A Quiet Place Part II will feature
several new faces.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:41.870
Cillian Murphy and Djimon Hounsou, among others,
are signed on to play other survivors in the

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.229
newly expanded world.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:48.770
A Quiet Place was John Krasinski's first horror
effort at the helm, but he did much more than

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:50.340
sit in the director's chair.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:55.120
While writers Bryan Woods and Scott Beck are
credited with the original story for the film,

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.969
Krasinski also earned a writing credit on
the first movie after stepping in to rewrite

00:01:58.969 --> 00:02:00.500
Beck and Woods' original script.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:05.020
That made his stamp on the project even more
personal something he's carrying over in a

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.640
big way for the second installment.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:11.800
This time around, Krasinski is both the director
and the sole credited writer, with Beck and

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:15.060
Woods credited only as the creators of the
characters from the original film.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:20.410
A Quiet Place left the Abbott family in a
precarious but promising situation in its

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:21.220
final minutes.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:26.300
With their soundproofed barn basement flooded,
Evelyn caring for a new baby, and older children

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:31.010
Regan and Marcus trying to escape one of the
creatures, Lee Abbott made the ultimate sacrifice

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:35.060
for his family, allowing a creature to kill
him so the kids could reunite with their mother.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.480
After the reunion, Regan and Evelyn were able
to kill the creature when Regan realized she

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:44.060
could amplify the feedback her cochlear implant
was emitting when the creatures were near,

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.760
causing it to spasm and creating an opening
to kill it.

00:02:53.129 --> 00:02:57.379
The sequel will presumably present an opportunity
for the Abbotts to share their newfound skills

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:00.120
with the rest of the world, provided they
can find more humans.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:04.640
Plus, if a cochlear implant can help take
the creatures down, what else can?

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:08.690
We could be looking at a film that finds some
very inventive new ways to weaponize sound,

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:11.910
both as a monster-slaying weapon and as a
moviemaking tool.

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:16.850
One of the great appeals of A Quiet Place
is its ability to captivate while only telling

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:20.260
us what we need to know to follow the story
and the rules of the world.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:24.620
As a result, we have very little confirmed
information about the things that make the

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.880
Earth "a quiet place" — the creatures.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:30.900
We know that they are extraterrestrial in
their origin, and the film tells us that they

00:03:30.901 --> 00:03:35.330
were able to effectively wipe out most humans
and a number of other animals on Earth in

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:38.180
a matter of months, driving the survivors
into hiding.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:42.360
We know that they have incredibly sensitive
hearing that allows them to sense nearly any

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.830
sound from some distance away, that their
skin is armored, and that sounds above a certain

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:51.319
register cause them to become disoriented
and expose the vulnerable parts of their body,

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:53.180
offering an avenue by which to kill them.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:58.319
So, will A Quiet Place Part II keep these
rules — and only these rules — in place,

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.160
or will we learn more about these mysterious
beings?

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:06.120
The answer may lie in one particular revelation
from the first A Quiet Place press tour: at

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.380
one point, it could have been a Cloverfield
movie.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:12.420
According to the original screenwriters, while
they were still in the script stages of developing

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:16.290
the first film, there was an idea that perhaps
the creatures at the heart of it could be

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.440
tied to the same ones within the Cloverfield
universe.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:23.720
Beck and Woods noted that Paramount Pictures
ultimately saw their film as, quote, "a totally

00:04:23.729 --> 00:04:28.790
different movie," but the possibility was
there, and that raises an interesting question:

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:33.460
if A Quiet Place Part II hits as big as its
predecessor did, what comes next?

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:37.300
Is it possible that this film's universe could
expand to be part of something bigger?

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.260
Could a crossover still happen?

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:43.040
It seems unlikely, but at the very least it's
amusing to think about.

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:48.320
The first full trailer for A Quiet Place Part
II arrived on New Year's Day 2020, and revealed

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.960
some of what's next for the Abbott family
as they venture out beyond their farmhouse.

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:56.300
Before that, though, it took us all the way
back to the first day of the end of the world,

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.210
and showed us a harrowing sequence in which
Evelyn is trying to drive her children through

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.160
a panicking neighborhood as the world descends
into chaos.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:07.780
Back in the present, the Abbotts are heading
out into the world with Evelyn's new baby,

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:11.800
who's largely confined to a box with an oxygen
mask and tank hooked up to it.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:16.630
Evelyn, Regan, and Marcus stumble upon Emmett,
who doesn't seem at all happy to see them.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:20.190
As Emily argues that there are still people
out in the world who are "worth saving," a

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.000
series of chilling visuals hint that she may
be wrong.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:27.300
It's an intriguing "the real monsters are
among us" setup, and we can't wait to see

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.300
where it goes next.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:29.480
"There's nothing left."

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:34.760
A Quiet Place Part II hits theaters March
20, 2020, very nearly two years to the day

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:37.400
after the first film's debut in 2018.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:41.900
Some sequels may take years to fall into place,
but we won't have to wait much longer to see

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:42.480
this one.

